Z||000014||fieroshop||04-04-2000||08:39 PM||||Hey bhooper, if your transaxle does not have the shaft on it then your thowout bearing is riding on the input shaft and that is a no no. ||||reg||1
Z||000015||Rodney||04-04-2000||09:01 PM||||All 282 Getrags have the same input shaft bearing/seal/sleeve assembly as far as I have ever seen. Fiero or FWD type.<P>Rodney Dickman Getrag guy||||reg||1
